422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (As we continue our journey toward academic and professional distinction, I am confident that the Placement and Training Cell will remain a cornerstone of student development and institutional success. Together, we will keep striving to empower every SIT student to become a leader, innovator, and changemaker in their chosen field.2024, SIT Hyderabad aims to deliver world-class technical education and serve as a hub for innovation and research. We currently offer a Bachelor of Technology \(B.Tech\) program in Computer Science and Engineering, designed to equip students with strong fundamentals, hands-on skills, and a mindset for lifelong learning. Our mission is to nurture human potential and empower students to become socially responsible leaders and innovators. Our strength lies in our exceptional faculty and a diverse student community. Together, they contribute to a rich academic culture where learning goes beyond the classroom. The institute actively promotes research, with faculty and students publishing in reputed journals and participating in leading conferences globally.)
/E (As we continue our journey toward academic and professional distinction, I am confident that the Placement and Training Cell will remain a cornerstone of student development and institutional success. Together, we will keep striving to empower every SIT student to become a leader, innovator, and changemaker in their chosen field.2024, SIT Hyderabad aims to deliver world-class technical education and serve as a hub for innovation and research. We currently offer a Bachelor of Technology \(B.Tech\) program in Computer Science and Engineering, designed to equip students with strong fundamentals, hands-on skills, and a mindset for lifelong learning. Our mission is to nurture human potential and empower students to become socially responsible leaders and innovators. Our strength lies in our exceptional faculty and a diverse student community. Together, they contribute to a rich academic culture where learning goes beyond the classroom. The institute actively promotes research, with faculty and students publishing in reputed journals and participating in leading conferences globally.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (To strengthen the education-industry interface, we host regular Industry-Academia Conclaves and emphasise internships and project-based learning. Our Career Development Centre plays a vital role not only in placements but also in preparing students for successful careers through mentorship and skill development. We continue to invest in state-of-the-art infrastructure, with advanced labs and research centres focused on artificial intelligence, data science, high-performance computing, and more. At SIT Hyderabad, we are committed to shaping the next generation of thinkers, doers, and changemakers. We invite you to join us on this journey of innovation, excellence, and impact. Welcome to a journey of excellence, exploration, and endless possibilities.)
